[Negotiation menu on knockout (test v2)]
author=Claude for V
description=When you knock out a non-boss enemy in story mode, the game normally plays a short after-KO talk (Battle_StartTalk kind 1). This turns it into the threaten talk (kind 0), so the RECRUIT/ROB/INTERROGATE/BEATDOWN/CANCEL menu opens, but only when that enemy shows a Pride bar (Battle_PrideHudShown 0x002E3A20, which also rules out group fights). The knocked-out enemy's Pride is set to 0 first. v2: CANCEL on a knocked-out enemy (0 HP) gives the normal after-KO ending (kind 1, step 1600); on a living enemy (manual threaten) it stays vanilla. Triangle now jumps to CANCEL in this menu. Hooks at 0x002DE478 and 0x002DEF70, caves 0x003E0168-0x003E017C and 0x00218F00-0x00218F40 (end of the unused library function the roster uses the start of). v1 and v2 tested in PCSX2 2026-10-13. See docs/mods/PLAN-auto-negotiation.md.
patch=1,EE,203E0168,extended,03E0882D
patch=1,EE,203E016C,extended,0C0B8E88
patch=1,EE,203E0170,extended,00000000
