[Aaron keeps his moves but grapples like Jason G (one Aaron cheat at a time)]
author=Claude for V
description=Mixed moveset made by bdkit.py mix-moveset AARON JASON_G --take grab. Aaron's command list (style 0x13) is rebuilt at 0x00217000 with all his own strikes, kicks and specials, but every grab comes from Jason G: Neck Throw, Stunner (grab up P), Power Bomb (grab down P), Belly to Belly Suplex (grab left/right P), Scissors Kick, Position Change (grab G), Giant Swing, Back Drop and Spine Buster. Jason G's animation groups 183 and 209 are loaded next to Aaron's. The MOVE LIST screen shows the mix too: small hooks at 0x00217A00 on the four move list functions (0x1C5BA0, 0x1C5BF0, 0x1C5C30, 0x1C5C70) swap Aaron's six grab lines for Jason G's eleven, and the copied unlock conditions point at the new lines. Turn on only one Aaron cheat at a time, and restart the game after switching.
patch=1,EE,2050D8B4,extended,00000013
patch=1,EE,2050D8BC,extended,0050D100
patch=1,EE,20515C5C,extended,00217000
